(F,"- **main-board** (STEP): the bare board core with the antenna notch; no other hole. No mask, pads, copper or parts: a board house needs Gerber and drill files.","- **main-board** (STEP): the bare board core, 27.2 x 12.6, no notch (since model v9; the antenna notch of earlier versions is gone) and no hole. No mask, pads, copper or parts: a board house needs Gerber and drill files.\n- **radio-corner** (STEP and STL): RC1, the resin radio corner of the body (X -14.80 to -8.60, Y 2.05 to the outer skin, 6.05 x 5.325 x 2.75, 26.4218 mm3, with the antenna floor pocket 0.20 deep), the same at every size; the body files have this corner cut away. Resin: Master Bond EP30Med, as the liner, cast on its own and bonded to the body before the board goes in (`specs/body.md` section Radio corner RC1; `assembly/assembly.md` step 10).","model v9 (section m row parts-notes.md line 28 'and a radio-corner line'); lead-decisions.md row 'resin radio corner RC1, how it is made'"),
